NOTICE — Third-party components and what this repository does NOT ship
=======================================================================

This repository ships VoiceLab's own Python code, config templates and docs.
It deliberately does NOT contain any of the following. Every one of them is
fetched by the user on first setup (see docs/环境重建.md) and remains under
its own license:

  * GPT-SoVITS (https://github.com/RVC-Boss/GPT-SoVITS) — MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2024 RVC-Boss.
    VoiceLab drives it as a vendored checkout at `_src/GPT-SoVITS-main/`
    and does not fork or relicense it. Its pretrained checkpoints
    (s1v3.ckpt, s2Gv3.pth, chinese-roberta-wwm-ext-large,
    chinese-hubert-base, BigVGAN v2, G2PW) are downloaded separately and
    are NOT part of this repository.

  * Qwen3-ASR (https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-ASR) — used for automatic
    transcript annotation. Model weights are downloaded by
    `tools/fetch_qwen_asr.py` into `models/asr/`. Check the upstream
    repository for the applicable terms before use.

  * Ultimate Vocal Remover models (Kim_Vocal_2, UVR-MDX-NET-Voc_FT,
    UVR-MDX-NET-Inst_HQ_3, Reverb_HQ_By_FoxJoy) plus the
    `audio-separator` package. Weight files live in `uvr5/weights/` after
    you download them; they are NOT part of this repository.

  * nltk corpora: `cmudict`, `averaged_perceptron_tagger_eng`.
    `runtime/nltk_data/` is provided as a convenience mirror of publicly
    distributed nltk data under nltk's own terms; delete it and re-download
    with `nltk.download(...)` if you prefer.

No voice data, no trained voice models, and no reference audio are included.
`config.json`, `data/`, `models/`, `out/`, `logs/`, `uploads/`, `_weight_backup/`
and the `.venv-*` environments are all excluded via `.gitignore` — they hold
personal audio, voice-identity data, trained weights and machine-bound
environments.
